  "slug": "baked-eggs-with-parmesan-and-cream",
  "title": "Baked Eggs with Parmesan and Cream",
  "blurb": "Soft eggs baked in butter and cream with a golden Parmesan crust.",
  "steps": [
    "Heat your oven to 190°C (170°C fan).",
    "Grease a small ovenproof dish or ramekin with the butter, making sure the base and sides are coated.",
    "Pour the cream into the dish and crack the eggs on top, keeping the yolks intact.",
    "Scatter the Parmesan over the eggs and grind black pepper over the surface.",
    "Bake for 10 to 12 minutes until the whites are just set but the yolks remain runny.",
    "Remove from the oven and let it stand for a minute before serving."
